WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.337
yabbistir grows with extensions.

00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:04.002
Here are five from its store.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.752
Secret Guard keeps API keys and
private keys out of your history.

00:00:08.752 --> 00:00:11.522
The copy still pastes,
but it's never stored.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.517
Safe Paste flags hidden
characters and risky commands.

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.300
Paste safely leaves the
command at the prompt,

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.417
so nothing runs before you read it.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.584
Authenticator types your two-factor codes.

00:00:27.584 --> 00:00:30.751
They're made on your Mac, and
the panel never shows them.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:37.996
AI Writing fixes and rewrites
your text with Apple Intelligence,

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.049
right on your Mac.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.231
GitHub turns your review
requests into a column.

00:00:46.231 --> 00:00:48.466
Shift Return pastes a Markdown link.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.216
Thirty-six extensions,
free and open source.

00:00:55.216 --> 00:00:56.631
yabbistir, on GitHub.
